<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>kinda smacks</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Royal &amp; the Serpent, GAYLE</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">kinda smacks</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4cwi0Yd3pq1GfvHj7FLMdn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.026" end="00:10.354">I did not expect you home so soon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.354" end="00:11.947">Might wanna take a seat babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.947" end="00:13.539">I see that you’re confused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.539" end="00:17.000">And I thought I could keep this to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.000" end="00:18.729">But I can’t no I can’t</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.729" end="00:21.563">And I think I need some help</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.563" end="00:28.561">I know this makes things complicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.561" end="00:34.677">But I just really gotta say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.677" end="00:37.040">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.040" end="00:38.769">And it makes me kinda sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.769" end="00:42.043">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.043" end="00:43.958">I know I said that it was whack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.958" end="00:45.669">But I gotta take it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.669" end="00:48.664">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.664" end="00:50.916">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.916" end="00:52.643">And it makes me kinda sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.643" end="00:55.931">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.931" end="00:57.874">I know I said that it was whack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.874" end="00:59.591">But I gotta take it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.591" end="01:02.653">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.653" end="01:05.532">I did not think I’d be home this soon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.532" end="01:11.181">I heard familiar voices bouncing off the walls inside our room, and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.181" end="01:12.885">I kinda like it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.885" end="01:14.385">I just never brought it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.214" end="01:17.248">Because I didn’t know you knew</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.248" end="01:24.129">I know this makes things complicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.129" end="01:30.456">But I just really gotta say it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.456" end="01:32.624">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.624" end="01:34.361">And it makes me kinda sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.361" end="01:37.670">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.670" end="01:39.632">I know I said that it was whack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.632" end="01:41.323">But I gotta take it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.323" end="01:44.365">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.365" end="01:46.559">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.559" end="01:48.250">And it makes me kinda sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.250" end="01:51.490">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.490" end="01:53.490">I know I said that it was whack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.490" end="01:55.189">But I gotta take it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.189" end="01:58.286">Cause I can’t stop listening, listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.286" end="02:02.882">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.882" end="02:05.313">Kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.313" end="02:10.090">Your ex-boyfriend's music kinda smacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.090" end="02:14.090">Kinda smacks</p></div></body></tt>